---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /
title: "Think by Numbers"
description: "Earth as it is and as it could be, in numbers: healthy life expectancy, income, cures per year, the cost of a trial, and the loop that moves them."
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<style>
  .home {
    --home-paper: var(--color-bg);
    --home-paper-2: var(--color-paper);
    --home-ink: var(--color-text);
    --home-soft: var(--color-text-light);
    --home-rule: #dedede;
    --home-mono: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
    --home-serif: 'Crimson Text', 'Baskerville', 'Georgia', serif;
    color: var(--home-ink);
    background: var(--home-paper);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .home { --home-rule: #333333; }

  .home h1, .home h2 { margin: 0; text-wrap: balance; line-height: 1.12; }
  .home p { margin: 0; }
  .home a { color: var(--home-ink); text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; text-underline-offset: 0.18em; text-decoration-color: var(--home-soft); }
  .home a:hover { text-decoration-color: var(--home-ink); }
  .home :focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--home-ink); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .home-wrap { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 clamp(16px, 4vw, 32px); }
  .home-sec { padding-top: 4rem; }
  .home h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .home .home-text { max-width: 66ch; font-size: 1.08rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; }
  .home-part { padding-top: 2.75rem; }
  .home-part:first-of-type { padding-top: 0; }

  /* Tagline and objective */
  .home-top { padding-top: 3.5rem; text-align: center; }
  .home-top h1 { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .home-top h1 {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5.6vw, 4.2rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    max-width: 18ch;
    margin: 0 auto 1.4rem;
  }


  /* Diagrams */
  .home-figure { margin: 0; }
  .home-figure-scroll { overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
  .home-figure svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; }
  .home-figure .home-diagram-wide { max-width: 820px; min-width: 620px; }
  .home-figure .home-diagram-tall { display: none; max-width: 360px; }
  .home-figure figcaption { font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--home-soft); margin: 0.5rem auto 0; max-width: 820px; }
  .home-diagram .box { fill: var(--home-paper-2); stroke: var(--home-ink); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .home-diagram .box-missing { fill: none; stroke: var(--home-soft); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .home-diagram .wire { fill: none; stroke: var(--home-ink); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .home-diagram .wire-missing { fill: none; stroke: var(--home-soft); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 5; }
  .home-diagram .t { font-family: var(--home-serif); font-size: 15px; fill: var(--home-ink); }
  .home-diagram .t-sub { font-family: var(--home-mono); font-size: 10px; fill: var(--home-soft); letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  .home-diagram .t-side { font-family: var(--home-serif); font-style: italic; font-size: 16px; fill: var(--home-ink); }
  .home-diagram .t-note { font-family: var(--home-mono); font-size: 11px; fill: var(--home-soft); letter-spacing: 0.06em; }

  /* Papers */
  .home-papers { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.75rem 1.5rem; }
  .home-paper { border: 1px solid var(--home-rule); background: var(--home-paper-2); display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .home-paper img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--home-rule); }
  .home-paper-name { font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.3; margin: 0.9rem 1rem 0.3rem; }
  .home-paper-name a { text-decoration: none; }
  .home-paper-name a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .home-paper-title { font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--home-soft); margin: 0 1rem 1rem; }
  .home-end { padding-bottom: 1.5rem; }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .home-papers { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .home-papers { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .home-figure-scroll { display: none; }
    .home-figure .home-diagram-tall { display: block; }
  }
</style>

<div class="home" data-pagefind-ignore>

  <section class="home-wrap home-top">
    <h1>{{ site.description }}.</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="home-wrap home-sec" aria-label="How the loop works">
    <svg width="0" height="0" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" style="position:absolute">
      <defs>
        <marker id="arrow-ink" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="var(--color-text)"/></marker>
        <marker id="arrow-soft" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="var(--color-text-light)"/></marker>
      </defs>
    </svg>
    <div class="home-part">
      <h2>How an oven works</h2>
      <p class="home-text">You set a temperature. A thermometer measures the actual temperature, compares it to the setting, and turns the heat up or down until the two match.</p>
      <figure class="home-figure">
        <div class="home-figure-scroll">
          <svg class="home-diagram home-diagram-wide" viewBox="0 0 780 130" role="img" aria-labelledby="oven-title">
            <title id="oven-title">An oven: set the temperature, the heating element heats the oven, dinner cooks, and a thermometer feeds back to the setting.</title>
            <rect class="box" x="20" y="20" width="118" height="44" rx="2"/>
            <text class="t" x="79" y="47" text-anchor="middle">Set 180°</text>
            <path class="wire" d="M138 42 H176" marker-end="url(#arrow-ink)"/>
            <rect class="box" x="178" y="20" width="150" height="44" rx="2"/>
            <text class="t" x="253" y="47" text-anchor="middle">Heating element</text>
            <path class="wire" d="M328 42 H366" marker-end="url(#arrow-ink)"/>
            <rect class="box" x="368" y="20" width="104" height="44" rx="2"/>
            <text class="t" x="420" y="47" text-anchor="middle">Oven</text>
            <path class="wire" d="M472 42 H510" marker-end="url(#arrow-ink)"/>
            <rect class="box" x="512" y="20" width="104" height="44" rx="2"/>
            <text class="t" x="564" y="47" text-anchor="middle">Dinner</text>
            <path class="wire" d="M420 64 V96 H79 V68" marker-end="url(#arrow-ink)"/>
            <text class="t-note" x="250" y="113" text-anchor="middle">THERMOMETER: MEASURES, COMPARES TO THE SETTING, ADJUSTS</text>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <svg class="home-diagram home-diagram-tall" viewBox="0 0 340 272" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <rect class="box" x="90" y="10" width="200" height="40" rx="2"/>
          <text class="t" x="190" y="35" text-anchor="middle">Set 180°</text>
          <path class="wire" d="M190 50 V68" marker-end="url(#arrow-ink)"/>
          <rect class="box" x="90" y="70" width="200" height="40" rx="2"/>
          <text class="t" x="190" y="95" text-anchor="middle">Heating element</text>
          <path class="wire" d="M190 110 V128" marker-end="url(#arrow-ink)"/>
          <rect class="box" x="90" y="130" width="200" height="40" rx="2"/>
          <text class="t" x="190" y="155" text-anchor="middle">Oven</text>
          <path class="wire" d="M190 170 V188" marker-end="url(#arrow-ink)"/>
          <rect class="box" x="90" y="190" width="200" height="40" rx="2"/>
          <text class="t" x="190" y="215" text-anchor="middle">Dinner</text>
          <path class="wire" d="M90 150 H40 V30 H86" marker-end="url(#arrow-ink)"/>
          <text class="t-note" x="190" y="252" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:9.5px">THERMOMETER: MEASURES,</text>
          <text class="t-note" x="190" y="265" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:9.5px">COMPARES TO THE SETTING, ADJUSTS</text>
        </svg>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="home-part">
      <h2>How a government works</h2>
      <p class="home-text">It announces a policy and spends the budget. Nothing measures whether the policy did what it was supposed to do, so nothing gets adjusted.</p>
      <figure class="home-figure">
        <div class="home-figure-scroll">
          <svg class="home-diagram home-diagram-wide" viewBox="0 0 780 125" role="img" aria-labelledby="gov-title">
            <title id="gov-title">A government: announce a policy, spend the budget, outcomes, and then a question mark. No sensor, no comparison, no adjustment.</title>
            <rect class="box" x="20" y="20" width="150" height="44" rx="2"/>
            <text class="t" x="95" y="47" text-anchor="middle">Announce a policy</text>
            <path class="wire" d="M170 42 H208" marker-end="url(#arrow-ink)"/>
            <rect class="box" x="210" y="20" width="150" height="44" rx="2"/>
            <text class="t" x="285" y="47" text-anchor="middle">Spend the budget</text>
            <path class="wire" d="M360 42 H398" marker-end="url(#arrow-ink)"/>
            <rect class="box" x="400" y="20" width="120" height="44" rx="2"/>
            <text class="t" x="460" y="47" text-anchor="middle">Outcomes</text>
            <path class="wire-missing" d="M520 42 H558" marker-end="url(#arrow-soft)"/>
            <rect class="box-missing" x="560" y="20" width="56" height="44" rx="2"/>
            <text class="t" x="588" y="48" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--color-text-light)">?</text>
            <path class="wire-missing" d="M460 64 V96 H330"/>
            <text class="t-note" x="326" y="100" text-anchor="end">NO SENSOR · NO COMPARISON · NO ADJUSTMENT</text>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <svg class="home-diagram home-diagram-tall" viewBox="0 0 340 272" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <rect class="box" x="90" y="10" width="200" height="40" rx="2"/>
          <text class="t" x="190" y="35" text-anchor="middle">Announce a policy</text>
          <path class="wire" d="M190 50 V68" marker-end="url(#arrow-ink)"/>
          <rect class="box" x="90" y="70" width="200" height="40" rx="2"/>
          <text class="t" x="190" y="95" text-anchor="middle">Spend the budget</text>
          <path class="wire" d="M190 110 V128" marker-end="url(#arrow-ink)"/>
          <rect class="box" x="90" y="130" width="200" height="40" rx="2"/>
          <text class="t" x="190" y="155" text-anchor="middle">Outcomes</text>
          <path class="wire-missing" d="M190 170 V188" marker-end="url(#arrow-soft)"/>
          <rect class="box-missing" x="160" y="190" width="60" height="40" rx="2"/>
          <text class="t" x="190" y="216" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--color-text-light)">?</text>
          <path class="wire-missing" d="M90 150 H40 V100"/>
          <text class="t-note" x="190" y="252" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:9.5px">NO SENSOR · NO COMPARISON</text>
          <text class="t-note" x="190" y="265" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:9.5px">NO ADJUSTMENT</text>
        </svg>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="home-part">
      <h2>How a government should work</h2>
      <p class="home-text">The goal is the general welfare, measured as the median person's healthy years and income, with priorities set by people rather than lobbyists. A controller funds what moves those numbers and defunds what does not. Trials measure which treatments work and data from thousands of jurisdictions measures which policies work, and the results feed back to the start. The whole loop is optimal governance.</p>
      <figure class="home-figure">
        <div class="home-figure-scroll">
          <svg class="home-diagram home-diagram-wide" viewBox="0 0 780 250" role="img" aria-labelledby="loop2-title">
            <title id="loop2-title">A closed loop: the goal, a controller, the actions, outcomes, and sensors feeding back to the goal.</title>
            <rect class="box" x="20" y="40" width="168" height="62" rx="2"/>
            <text class="t" x="104" y="64" text-anchor="middle">The goal</text>
            <text class="t-sub" x="104" y="80" text-anchor="middle">THE GENERAL WELFARE</text>
            <text class="t-sub" x="104" y="93" text-anchor="middle">PRIORITIES: WISHOCRACY</text>
            <path class="wire" d="M188 71 H208" marker-end="url(#arrow-ink)"/>
            <rect class="box" x="210" y="40" width="168" height="62" rx="2"/>
            <text class="t" x="294" y="64" text-anchor="middle">The controller</text>
            <text class="t-sub" x="294" y="80" text-anchor="middle">OPTIMITRON</text>
            <text class="t-sub" x="294" y="93" text-anchor="middle">FUNDS WHAT WORKS</text>
            <path class="wire" d="M378 71 H398" marker-end="url(#arrow-ink)"/>
            <rect class="box" x="400" y="40" width="168" height="62" rx="2"/>
            <text class="t" x="484" y="64" text-anchor="middle">The actions</text>
            <text class="t-sub" x="484" y="80" text-anchor="middle">DECENTRALIZED FDA · DIH</text>
            <text class="t-sub" x="484" y="93" text-anchor="middle">INCENTIVE ALIGNMENT BONDS</text>
            <path class="wire" d="M568 71 H588" marker-end="url(#arrow-ink)"/>
            <rect class="box" x="590" y="40" width="168" height="62" rx="2"/>
            <text class="t" x="674" y="64" text-anchor="middle">Outcomes</text>
            <text class="t-sub" x="674" y="80" text-anchor="middle">HEALTHY YEARS AND INCOME</text>
            <text class="t-sub" x="674" y="93" text-anchor="middle">OF THE MEDIAN PERSON</text>
            <path class="wire" d="M674 102 V170 H612" marker-end="url(#arrow-ink)"/>
            <rect class="box" x="270" y="140" width="340" height="62" rx="2"/>
            <text class="t" x="440" y="164" text-anchor="middle">The sensors</text>
            <text class="t-sub" x="440" y="180" text-anchor="middle">TRIALS SHOW WHICH TREATMENTS WORK</text>
            <text class="t-sub" x="440" y="193" text-anchor="middle">POLICY DATA SHOWS WHICH POLICIES WORK: OPTIMOCRACY</text>
            <path class="wire" d="M270 170 H104 V106" marker-end="url(#arrow-ink)"/>
            <text class="t-note" x="176" y="188" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:9px">MEASURE, COMPARE, ADJUST</text>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <svg class="home-diagram home-diagram-tall" viewBox="0 0 340 400" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <rect class="box" x="70" y="10" width="240" height="56" rx="2"/>
          <text class="t" x="190" y="30" text-anchor="middle">The goal</text>
          <text class="t-sub" x="190" y="45" text-anchor="middle">THE GENERAL WELFARE</text>
          <text class="t-sub" x="190" y="58" text-anchor="middle">PRIORITIES: WISHOCRACY</text>
          <path class="wire" d="M190 66 V84" marker-end="url(#arrow-ink)"/>
          <rect class="box" x="70" y="86" width="240" height="56" rx="2"/>
          <text class="t" x="190" y="106" text-anchor="middle">The controller</text>
          <text class="t-sub" x="190" y="121" text-anchor="middle">OPTIMITRON</text>
          <text class="t-sub" x="190" y="134" text-anchor="middle">FUNDS WHAT WORKS</text>
          <path class="wire" d="M190 142 V160" marker-end="url(#arrow-ink)"/>
          <rect class="box" x="70" y="162" width="240" height="56" rx="2"/>
          <text class="t" x="190" y="182" text-anchor="middle">The actions</text>
          <text class="t-sub" x="190" y="197" text-anchor="middle">DECENTRALIZED FDA · DIH</text>
          <text class="t-sub" x="190" y="210" text-anchor="middle">INCENTIVE ALIGNMENT BONDS</text>
          <path class="wire" d="M190 218 V236" marker-end="url(#arrow-ink)"/>
          <rect class="box" x="70" y="238" width="240" height="56" rx="2"/>
          <text class="t" x="190" y="258" text-anchor="middle">Outcomes</text>
          <text class="t-sub" x="190" y="273" text-anchor="middle">HEALTHY YEARS AND INCOME</text>
          <text class="t-sub" x="190" y="286" text-anchor="middle">OF THE MEDIAN PERSON</text>
          <path class="wire" d="M190 294 V312" marker-end="url(#arrow-ink)"/>
          <rect class="box" x="70" y="314" width="240" height="72" rx="2"/>
          <text class="t" x="190" y="334" text-anchor="middle">The sensors</text>
          <text class="t-sub" x="190" y="349" text-anchor="middle">TRIALS: WHICH TREATMENTS WORK</text>
          <text class="t-sub" x="190" y="362" text-anchor="middle">POLICY DATA: WHICH POLICIES WORK</text>
          <text class="t-sub" x="190" y="375" text-anchor="middle">OPTIMOCRACY</text>
          <path class="wire" d="M70 350 H30 V38 H66" marker-end="url(#arrow-ink)"/>
          <text class="t-note" x="20" y="196" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-90 20 196)" style="font-size:9px">MEASURE, COMPARE, ADJUST</text>
        </svg>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-wrap home-sec home-end" aria-label="Papers">
    <div class="home-papers">
      {%- for paper in papers %}
      <div class="home-paper">
        <a href="{{ paper.url }}"><img src="{{ paper.image }}" alt="" width="1376" height="768"{% if loop.index0 > 2 %} loading="lazy"{% endif %}></a>
        <p class="home-paper-name"><a href="{{ paper.url }}">{{ paper.name }}</a></p>
        <p class="home-paper-title">{{ paper.title }}</p>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
